   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Socialantropologiska inst. G&#xf6;teborgs univ. f&#xe5;r st&#xf6;d f&#xf6;r kapacitetsupp-byggnad v g antropologi i Vietnam. Kurser, handledning, studentutbyte,svenska studenter g&#xf6;r f&#xe4;ltarbeten, konferenser o dyl. &#xc4;ven regionalt samarbete. Avsikten &#xe4;r att ge vietnamesiska antropologer tillg&#xe5;ng tillmodern, v&#xe4;sterl&#xe4;ndsk antropologisk teori och metodik.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Dept. of Social Antrhopology at G&#xf6;teborg Univ. receives support from Sida/NATUR in order to strengthen anthropological capacity in Vietnam: teaching, advise, conferences, student-exchange, Swedish students do fieldwork in Vietnam. Also strengthening of regional networks.</narrative>
